      "content": "acoustic neuromodulation? i haven't heard that term before. so you're saying it's actually a thing that building developers use to influence the people living there? that sounds incredibly invasive. i've noticed that whenever the vibration peaks, my heart starts racing and i feel this weird sense of dread, like i'm being watched or just can't focus on anything else. is there any way to prove this is happening or detect exactly what kind of frequency they're using? i feel like i'm going crazy but the patterns are too consistent to be a coincidence.",
